// 即使货已售罄或店已关闭，成本所借的真实交易源仍永久保留；不改未选私铺的16条回收规则。
#include "private_shop_trade_pins.hpp"
#include "resident/domains/growth/growth_life_results.hpp"
#include "resident/domains/organization/organization_office_history.hpp"
#include <set>
namespace hanmo::resident {
Outcome<std::vector<StableId>> read_private_shop_trade_pins(const CommonStore& common,const PrivateShopState& state,const GrowthState& growth){std::set<StableId> pins;const auto& facts=common.state().facts.order();for(const auto& row:state.purchases.rows()){const auto& p=row.second;const auto* shop=state.shops.find(p.shop_id);const auto* head=common.state().facts.find(row.first);const auto* trade=common.state().facts.find(p.trade_fact_id);const auto source=growth_life_result(growth,p.trade_fact_id);const auto id=organization_instance_sequence(row.first,"private_shop_stock"),original=organization_instance_sequence(p.trade_fact_id,"action");auto a=std::find(facts.begin(),facts.end(),p.trade_fact_id),b=std::find(facts.begin(),facts.end(),row.first);if(row.first!=p.id||!shop||!head||head->id!=p.id||head->kind!="private_shop_stock_received"||head->domain!=private_shop_module||!id||!original||*original>=*id||*id>=common.state().next_instance_id||!trade||trade->id!=p.trade_fact_id||trade->kind!="life_activity"||trade->domain!="growth"||a==facts.end()||b==facts.end()||a>=b||!source||source->fact_id!=p.trade_fact_id||source->action_id!=p.trade_fact_id||source->kind!=LifeActivityKind::trade||source->activity!="buy"||source->actor_id!=shop->terms.proprietor_actor_id||source->start_tick!=p.tick||source->settlement_tick!=p.tick||source->payer_wallet_id!=shop->wallet_id||source->to_inventory_id!=p.from_inventory_id||p.to_inventory_id!=shop->inventory_id||source->item_id!=p.item_id||source->quantity!=p.quantity||source->amount!=p.purchase_cash||!pins.insert(p.trade_fact_id).second)return {false,{},common_failure("PrivateShopTradePinSourceMismatch",p.id).error};}return {true,{pins.begin(),pins.end()},{}};}
}
